        <p>Una selezione delle nostre tariffe Luce e Gas in partnership con Nexicom.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="results-list" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:28px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
        <article class="offer-card">
          <div class="offer-card-ribbon">Offerta Solo Web</div>
          <div class="offer-card-body" style="padding:32px;">
            <div class="offer-card-header" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
              <div>
                <div class="offer-name-wrap"><span class="offer-name" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--font-h);">Solo Web - Variabile PUN</span></div>
                <div class="offer-provider" style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:4px;">Nexicom &middot; Luce &middot; Domestico</div>
              </div>
              <div class="offer-price-wrap" style="text-align:right;">
                <div class="offer-price" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);">PUN + 0,055 €/kWh</div>
                <div class="offer-price-detail" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">456 €/POD/anno</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="offer-features" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px;"><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> Prezzo indicizzato al PUN Index GME con spread fisso per 12 mesi.</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> 1,00 € sconto bolletta via e-mail</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> 1,00 € sconto addebito SDD</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> Corrispettivo: 456 €/POD/anno</span></div>
            <a href="tariffe.html" class="btn-primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">Scopri tutte le offerte</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="offer-card">
          <div class="offer-card-ribbon">Offerta Solo Web</div>
          <div class="offer-card-body" style="padding:32px;">
            <div class="offer-card-header" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
              <div>
                <div class="offer-name-wrap"><span class="offer-name" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--font-h);">Solo Web - Gas PSV</span></div>
                <div class="offer-provider" style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:4px;">Nexicom &middot; Gas &middot; Domestico</div>
              </div>
              <div class="offer-price-wrap" style="text-align:right;">
                <div class="offer-price" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);">PSV + 0,45 €/Smc</div>
                <div class="offer-price-detail" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">648 €/PDR/anno</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="offer-features" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px;"><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> Prezzo all&#x27;ingrosso indicizzato all&#x27;indice PSV Day Ahead, aggiornato mensilmente.</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> 1,00 € sconto bolletta via e-mail</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> 1,00 € sconto addebito SDD</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> Corrispettivo: 648 €/PDR/anno</span></div>
            <a href="tariffe.html" class="btn-primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">Scopri tutte le offerte</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="offer-card exclusive">
          <div class="offer-card-ribbon">&#11088; Con Logicard Casa</div>
          <div class="offer-card-body" style="padding:32px;">
            <div class="offer-card-header" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
              <div>
                <div class="offer-name-wrap"><span class="offer-name" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--font-h);">Solo Web - Variabile PUN Logicard Casa</span></div>
                <div class="offer-provider" style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:4px;">Nexicom &middot; Luce &middot; Domestico</div>
              </div>
              <div class="offer-price-wrap" style="text-align:right;">
                <div class="offer-price" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);">PUN + 0,05 €/kWh</div>
                <div class="offer-price-detail" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">456 €/POD/anno</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="offer-features" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px;"><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> Indicizzata al PUN con carta Logicard Casa (contributo 168 €+IVA/anno in 12 rate).</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> 1,00 € sconto bolletta via e-mail</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> 1,00 € sconto addebito SDD</span><span class="offer-tag" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-label);font-weight:500;"><span style="color:#10b981;">&#10003;</span> Corrispettivo: 456 €/POD/anno</span></div>
            <a href="tariffe.html" class="btn-primary" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">Scopri tutte le offerte</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px;">
        <a href="tariffe.html" class="btn-primary">Vedi tutte le offerte</a>
